              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "چھاپنا (chhāpnā) is a tadbhava, a word inherited and reshaped by sound change. It comes from chapp, \"press, cover, hide\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 4994). CDIAL notes that Punjabi and Sindhi took their verbs from this one."
